# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Stockly (ستوكلي) - .gitignore
# Secrets, build output, local environment and tooling artifacts must never
# be committed. See /docs/SECURITY_ARCHITECTURE.md section "Secrets Management".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Secrets / credentials -------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env.local
secrets/
secrets.*
*.secret
*.secrets
appsettings.*.local.json
appsettings.Local.json
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.cer
*.crt
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
service-account*.json
gha-creds-*.json

# NOTE: `Auth__IdentifierPepper` and token signing keys are supplied from a
# secret store / mounted file, never committed. `.env` and `.env.*` above cover
# the development case. Do not "fix" a missing secret by committing a value.

# NOTE: the empty nested repository at ./Stockly is intentionally NOT ignored.
# It is recorded as ISS-04 in docs/DEVELOPMENT_STATUS.md and awaits an owner
# decision. Adding it here would silently hide it; removing the directory would
# destroy possible user work. Both are forbidden without explicit instruction.

# ---- .NET / .NET Core ------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user
TestResults/
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coverlet.json
*.trx
*.coveragexml
*.opencover.xml
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# ---- Node / React / Vite / PWA --------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
coverage/
*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.eslintcache
stats.html
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---- Service worker / PWA generated assets --------------------------------
# Only build output. A hand-written `manifest.webmanifest` IS meant to be
# committed; if that pattern ever becomes a problem, scope it to the build
# output directory rather than the repository root.
dev-dist/
sw.js
sw.js.map
workbox-*.js
manifest.webmanifest

# ---- Database --------------------------------------------------------------
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.bak
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
db-snapshots/

# ---- IDEs ------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---- OS --------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ---- Logs / temp -----------------------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

# ---- Docker / infra --------------------------------------------------------
docker-compose.override.yml
docker/data/
docker/volumes/
*.local.crt
Caddyfile.local
Stockly/
